    "# The Butterfly Effect of War - Global Impact Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "> *\"When a butterfly flaps its wings in one part of the world, it can cause a hurricane somewhere else.\"*\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## What this notebook does\n",
    "\n",
    "When a war starts in one country, the shockwaves don't stop at its borders.  \n",
    "This notebook studies how conflict causes **ripple effects across the world** —  \n",
    "rising food prices, refugee crises, energy shocks, and political instability  \n",
    "in countries that never fired a single shot.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Three real ripple chains we analyze:**\n",
    "- 🇺🇦 **Ukraine 2022** → wheat shortage → hunger in Egypt & Lebanon\n",
    "- 🇸🇾 **Syria 2011** → 13.5M+ refugees → Lebanon's economy collapsed\n",
    "- 🇸🇩 **Sudan 2023** → world's largest displacement crisis → Chad, Egypt, Ethiopia destabilized\n",
    "- 🇮🇷 **Iran-Israel 2025/26** → Strait of Hormuz risk → global oil price shock\n",
    "- 🇵🇰 **Pakistan-Afghanistan 2026** → South Asia security crisis → regional trade disruption\n",
    "\n",
    "## Why it matters\n",
    "\n",
    "| Who benefits | How |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Governments | Predict economic shocks before they hit |\n",
    "| Journalists | Explain global consequences with real data |\n",
    "| NGOs | Decide where to send aid before the crisis peaks |\n",
    "| Regular people | Understand why their grocery bill went up |\n"
   ]
  },
