    "- **Panel D (Chokepoint chart)** - The core reason this conflict was so dangerous. The Strait of Hormuz is a narrow channel 33km wide at its narrowest point. Japan gets 75% of its oil through it. South Korea gets 70%. If Iran closes it, those countries face an energy crisis within weeks — despite being thousands of miles from the conflict."
